# Clusterfk-LLM

Multi-tier memory for LLM orchestration, an OpenAI-compatible router (vLLM + Ollama), and a CLI for quick debates/testing.

**💡 New to clusterfk-llm?** Run `clusterfk menu` for an interactive guided experience with hints and instructions!

