## 🛠 Installation

```bash
# Install Pfy task runner (recommended)
pip install pfy

# Clone and set up
git clone https://github.com/P4X-ng/clusterfk-llm.git
cd clusterfk-llm

# Set up environment
pf env-setup

# Install in development mode (choose one option)
pf install-native    # Creates venv and installs (recommended for new users)
# OR
pf install-base      # If you already have a Python environment set up

# Run tests
pf test
```

For manual installation without Pfy: `pip install -e .`

See [Quick Start Guide](QUICK_START.md) for detailed instructions and [Pfyfile Guide](PFYFILE_GUIDE.md) for all available tasks.

## 🧪 Testing

```bash
# Install test dependencies
pip install pytest pytest-asyncio

# Run all tests
pytest tests/ -v

# Run specific test modules
pytest tests/memory/test_models.py -v
pytest tests/memory/test_obsessions.py -v
pytest tests/memory/test_sqlite_tiers.py -v
```

